--- !u!114 &2081918313
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2081918312}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cb94c4da4de42a948a4e6c1867474d59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialManager
  steps:
  - title: Intro
    message: This world is not what it seems. Beneath its surface lies something
      ancient, something that does not welcome the unprepared. Before you take another
      step, pay attention. What you learn here may be the only thing standing between
      you and oblivion.
    panel: {fileID: 876711582}
    displayText: {fileID: 1746270060}
    fadeInDuration: 2
    fadeOutDuration: 0.1
    charDelayOverride: 0
    objectsToActivate: []
    objectsToDeactivate: []
  - title: Buttons
    message: These circular souls can be used to alter your view, although they are
      not labled so use what you learn from the environment around you to determine
      what they might do.
    panel: {fileID: 1584590609}
    displayText: {fileID: 779566916}
    fadeInDuration: 0
    fadeOutDuration: 0
    charDelayOverride: 0.05
    objectsToActivate: []
    objectsToDeactivate: []
  - title: Player
    message: As you have already seen, this is you. A strange bear with an unfamiliar
      whirring orb. What it is or who you truly are is a mystery.
    panel: {fileID: 626004534}
    displayText: {fileID: 678850908}
    fadeInDuration: 0
    fadeOutDuration: 0
    charDelayOverride: 0.05
    objectsToActivate:
    - {fileID: 944938352}
    objectsToDeactivate: []
  - title: Health
    message: This is your health bar, you'll be able to find it in the top left of
      your view, you may also use the F button to heal in desperate times. Just don't
      let it get to Zero... We will have to talk more on that if it happens.
    panel: {fileID: 6244825}
    displayText: {fileID: 388665875}
    fadeInDuration: 0
    fadeOutDuration: 0
    charDelayOverride: 0.05
    objectsToActivate:
    - {fileID: 0}
    objectsToDeactivate:
    - {fileID: 944938352}
  - title: Hotbar
    message: 'You can find your hotbar here at the bottom where you can choose to
      use 1 of 3 items. You may also use TAB to open your inventory. '
    panel: {fileID: 844775406}
    displayText: {fileID: 444913566}
    fadeInDuration: 0
    fadeOutDuration: 0
    charDelayOverride: 0.05
    objectsToActivate:
    - {fileID: 437950394}
    objectsToDeactivate:
    - {fileID: 0}
  - title: Outro
    message: There is still more you need to learn... Follow the fairy
    panel: {fileID: 789917635}
    displayText: {fileID: 1824608848}
    fadeInDuration: 0
    fadeOutDuration: 0
    charDelayOverride: 0.05
    objectsToActivate: []
    objectsToDeactivate:
    - {fileID: 437950394}
    - {fileID: 2081636390}
    - {fileID: 1711998719}
  nextButton: {fileID: 216625543}
  prevButton: {fileID: 1711998725}
  closeButton: {fileID: 2081636391}
  sceneButton: {fileID: 726082171}
  sceneToLoad: GameScene
  stepIndicatorText: {fileID: 1962866469}
